'''Important note about the light version:''' In 99% of the time when ending your combos meterlessly, using 214C is always the better option than 236B. 214C has better damage and better oki on hit, on top of being much safer if you miss your confirm. The only reason to use 236B is to get SLIGHTLY more corner carry which in most cases is not worth the damage and oki sacrifice.
