Another great tool in her arsenal, mainly for pressure and for Counter Hit combos. On Counter, both versions become high damage starters, as she gets a link into far C or 2C. The heavy version frame traps from close D and leaves Mai plus, which can lead to looping pressure that requires a Guard Cancel or risky mashing to escape.


