Ranged reversal (sadly not great against fireballs) and more damaging combo tool than Redline Kagerou. Can be braked, when you have this as your starter (eg.: as a reversal) you get to do marginally higher damage than you otherwise would while building a bit of Power Gauge back by dumping your entire Rev gauge into a combo, so if you're going for a kill combo and have Rev to spare it's useful.
|description2=
* Fully Invul.
A jumpscare waiting to happen. Unless you're trying to bait anti-airs in style this is probably a terrible usage of meter, as it does low damage and can't be followed up with a second super due to cost.
